  <content>
  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<example><exercise>
  <problem>
    
    <para>List these quantities in order, from least to greatest, without evaluating each expression. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
    <para> \(2^{10}\) </para>
      <para> \(10^2\) </para>
      <para> \(2^9\) </para>
      <para> \(9^2\) </para>
    <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.
    </para>
  </problem><solution>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
  <para>The correct order is \(9^2\), \(10^2\), \(2^9\), \(2^{10}\). This would be 18, 100, 512, 1024.</para>
</solution></exercise>
</example></section>
</content>
